corpus.jsonl.gz holds answers recorded from the reference Mithril
verification code: mithril-stm 0.13.0 and mithril-common 0.8.3 at Mithril
release 2642.0 (commit e85df3ddc52b528c7b9ddbdddf1941fec6d5f348), built
unmodified from crates.io with an additive patch exposing crate-private
functions to the recording harness. The inputs and the harness come from
mithril2pq (https://github.com/chrisguiney/mithril2pq,
internal/mithril/difftest), Copyright 2026 Chris Guiney, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. Each record is one request with its generator
arguments expanded, and the answer the Rust code gave.

